      "user": {
        "title": "Add a Smart Clock 2",
        "description": "Enter the clock's address. The clock is normally found automatically; use this if it isn't. The token is on the clock: swipe up from the bottom edge, open the quick panel, tap **Clock**, then **Show token** (spaces don't matter).",
